  "body": "Continues #4. Add an observer for the stages inside source loading and correct proof-allowance parsing: startup may leave slightly less than180 seconds for the child. The revised parser accepts finite numeric `0 < allowance <= 180`, rejects invalid/exhausted allowances, and keeps every original outer/scientific limit. Existing scientific source and data remain unchanged.\n\nThe complete ordinary/instrumented audit retains all three reads,432 profiles,1152 conditions and three comparison-only OpenSpiel workers. Calculated results agree exactly; all14 selected calls are present and aliases restore. [Report and two plots](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/49cb951/docs/source-phase-cpu.md): archive validation takes37\u201339 parent CPU seconds and earlier scientific-source checks33\u201334 per instrumented cost read, together87.5%/87.9% of source CPU. Complete commands take413.958874/415.107845 seconds; outer CLI832.062314. Maximum independent scalar discrepancy1.8474111129762605e-13 chips <1e-9.\n\n[Own evidence](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/bc82557/results/source-phase-cpu-v2/software-raw-manifest.json) was public and verified before reference use; [all27 raw pair files](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/e931955/results/source-phase-cpu-v2/pair-raw-manifest.json) before analysis. Three numerical exports reproduce byte for byte on both runtimes with50 numerical entry points blocked, zero forbidden calls and raw unchanged. Both figures inspected; journal128 and work log updated.\n\nFinal qualification passes all six roles at `49cb951983255b80804754d905119a5be0dfa946`, scientific fingerprint `5b966422276208f50fff1fc4ab4126271cb4405f39edbcc7a982329c86829ee9` (444 files):\n\n| Runtime | Local base | Relevant optional | Hosted base |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Python3.11.17 / NumPy2.4.6 | 5081 passed,68 skipped,150 deselected;900.69s | 1987 passed;745.01s | 5081 passed;1187.64s |\n| Python3.12.15 / NumPy2.5.4 | 5081 passed,68 skipped,150 deselected;880.55s | 1987 passed;527.81s | 5081 passed;1170.17s |\n\n[Both final hosted jobs](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/actions/runs/44055717608) verify actual patch/NumPy, every uv selection and the complete tested checkout tree. Local checks also pass Ruff, formatting, strict typing812 files and hooks;508 relative documentation destinations/7 images and heading/fence checks pass. Hosted bases retain the existing historical rounding warning.\n\nRetained failures matter: the original exact180 parser rejected a legitimate179.9989877909975 allowance; its attempted pair was blocked before any child/reference. The corrected own proof is fresh. Later local final bases timed out because a restricted linked-worktree Git index could not save its stat cache. [Failed roles, metadata traces and recovery](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/49cb951/results/source-phase-cpu-v2/qualification-history/final-index-refresh/manifest.json) remain; normal authorized index refresh resolves the condition, and every full final role was repeated on this evidence revision. No test/cap/algorithm/dependency/CI relaxation or scientific-pair retry.\n\nOne ordered diagnostic pair establishes neither stable overhead nor a causal speedup. No training, stronger/default/fresh/global admission or competitive full-game strength claim: the912.54/900-second forecast and2.390%/1% accuracy failures remain. OpenSpiel2.0.2/Apache-2.0 outputs stay scalar comparison-only, never agent inputs. Codex-assisted implementation, checks and documentation; self-review does not imply an independent reviewer. Main merge/preservation checks follow the passing final qualification.",
